{"availability":"available","full":"jakariatanjim-svg/aurabeats","name":"aurabeats","description":"AuraBeats — A multi-source music streaming engine. Aggregates YouTube Music, JioSaavn, SoundCloud, Audius, Jamendo, Internet Archive and live radio into one premium ad-free browser app. Dual theme engine, offline support, PWA installable. No sign-up needed.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":2,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-17T22:32:19Z","updated":"2026-10-11T05:54:26Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://aurabeats.pages.dev","topics":["ad-free","ad-free-music","audius","glassmorphism","jiosaavn","music-player","music-streaming","music-streaming-website","offline-first","online","pwa","react","soundcloud","tailwindcss","typescript","vite","web-app","youtube-music","youtube-music-ad-free","youtube-music-downloader"],"demo":"https://aurabeats.pages.dev/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T14:52:51.557Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T14:52:51.557Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T14:52:51.557Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T14:52:51.557Z","stars":2,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An ultra-modern, production-ready music streaming application that aggregates the world's largest audio catalogs into one seamless web experience. No API keys, no accounts, no subscriptions, no rate limits."],"features":["Dual Core: Seamlessly switches between a native HTML5 Audio engine (for direct MP3 sources) and a hidden, ad-free YouTube IFrame player.","Unified Controls: Play, pause, seek, and volume work identically across all sources.","Smart Failover: Automatically races multiple mirrors and fallback sources if a stream fails.","Every song is a complete, full-length recording streamed from multiple public networks.","Two-Tab Search: Dedicated filters for YT Music ( lyrics-friendly, fuzzy matching) and Other Sources (consolidated database results)."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jakariatanj